{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 33,
  "name": {
    "ja": "クローン地獄",
    "en": "The Cloning Pits",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "KILL_ALL",
    "level": 45,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "ここ数年、我々は強い剣闘士の軍勢を作るため、特別に強力な生物の",
          "クローンを作って来ました。しかしクローン研究所で何か非常にまずい",
          "ことが起きてしまいました。どうか全てのクローンを破壊して下さい。",
          "報酬ははずみます。内部の自動保安システムは止まってしまったため、",
          "クローンは魔法やテレポートや召喚をすることが出来ます。",
          "保安ロボットである『究極ダンジョンクリーナー』も暴走してしまった",
          "ので、それらも破壊して下さい。浮遊と強力な飛び道具が必要になる",
          "でしょう。入口は宿屋の裏の建物にあります。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "For the past few years we have been cloning exceptionally powerful ",
          "creatures for gladiatorial combat.  Something has gone very wrong in ",
          "the Cloning Pits. Please eliminate ALL the clones, you will be well",
          "rewarded.  The active security systems have stopped working. The",
          "clones can use magic, teleport, summon, etc..   \"The Ultimate Dungeon ",
          "Cleaner\" security bots are no longer controlled, so you will ",
          "eliminate them too.  Levitation and a good distance weapon are",
          "needed.  The entrance to the pits is in a building behind the inn.  ",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["素晴らしい!! お礼を外に置いておきました。"],
        "en": ["Impressive!! Your reward is waiting for you outside."],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["この仕事はあなたには難しかったようですね。"],
        "en": ["It seems like this task was too difficult for you."],
      },
    },
  ],
